# Database export bundles — produced by `pg_dump --inserts` against prod for
# staging-load workflows. Each subdir is date-stamped (e.g. 2026-04-26-staging-load,
# 2026-04-26-prod-snapshot). Files are large and prod-snapshot, never committed.
#
# This file itself is committed so the directory survives in the tree even
# when no exports are present locally.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
